  "content_en": "Chapter One: First Marriage in the Prince's Mansion. There was flickering light on the lake, and the weeping willows on the other side were sprouting fresh green. Their branches were dancing in the wind, showing the vitality of life, but it had nothing to do with Luo Xue. After breakfast, she sat on the veranda by the lake. The small building carefully decorated by Prince Yu was a prison in her heart. At this time, it was more like an excellent typhoon shelter. In the face of power, women are destined to be lonely night walkers, alone on the dark and blurry road; in front of their companions, women are also cold-faced killers, burying the seeds of hatred deep into the hearts of their enemies. Even if you get other people's happiness, will you really be happy? A woman is as infatuated as a woman, and a woman is as poisonous as a snake and scorpion. I'm afraid it's only when Gu Ying feels pity for herself that she reveals her true nature, right? It's ridiculous to think about myself, just to compete with a fortune teller I don't know, I made a hasty decision about my life. If Xunyang was still Xunyang, just a businessman, wouldn't there have been the overt and covert fighting just now? If there were no Xunyang, what kind of husband would dad look for for himself? Forget it, it was his father who adopted him, and he trained her carefully for five years, and cared for her as his own child for five years. Even though she was just a paving stone on his road to power, after all, he still gave himself a second life. If his father had not influenced his marriage, could he have reunited with the boy he met when he was a child? Yunnan is far away from the capital. Five years ago, war-torn Yunnan had thousands of casualties every day. Maybe... Thinking of this, Luo Xue did not dare to continue. She looked at the jade pendant in her hand intently, then put it on her face again and rubbed it repeatedly, as if it still had the warmth of five years ago. \"Princess, it's windy outside, please go back to the house.\" Xiao happy put a jacket on Luo Xue. Luo Xue wrapped her jacket slightly tightly and said, \"Xiao Xi, you just saw the princess in person. From now on, don't call me princess, please call me miss.\" \"Oh, Xiao Xi knows, but brother Xunyang said... Could it be that brother Xunyang is lying to us?\" \"Who doesn't say something pleasing to people?\" Luo Xue raised a fleeting smile. \"Impossible, I don't believe what he said was just for fun.\" Xiao happy's tone was a little excited. She didn't want to believe that brother Xunyang, whom she had known for several months, would deceive her about her relationship with the young lady. Putting the jade pendant away, Luo Xue smiled calmly, \"Silly girl, I didn't say cheating, just...\" She was at a loss for words. Faced with Xiao Xi in front of her, Luo Xue couldn't bear to lie to her. She was a simple and extremely persistent child, like the first ray of sunshine at dawn, clean and pure. She always believed that wrong is wrong and right is right. She would not understand what it means to be insincere, nor would she know that one of the human nature is duplicity. And Luo Xue also hopes that she will never understand. \"Miss, just what?\" Xiao happy blinked her watery eyes and asked expectantly. I desperately want to get a reason to feel at ease from the mouth of the lady I trust, even if it is just one word. \"What exactly is it?\" Prince Yu's profound voice floated from a distance, and he came closer in a moment. \"Xiao Xi, didn't I tell you to call you Princess? Why did you change it again?\" \"I asked her to call you Princess. I'm not used to hearing it. My sister is beautiful and smart, she is capable, and who can shake her position.\" When speaking, Luo Xue deliberately distanced herself. Yes, who can shake her position now? In the morning, the imperial doctor told him that the princess was pregnant. Such news was undoubtedly a bolt from the blue. She was the royal concubine, and her heir would inherit the throne. When the child is born, will she still abide by the original agreement? Prince Yu didn't want to think about it anymore. He hugged Luo Xue with one hand, looked to the other side, and said, \"Luo Xue, would you like to give birth to a child for me?\" \"So what if I give birth? It's nothing more than a paving stone for others to step on.\". Luo Xue knows that the legitimate son is the eldest. The fate of a child born from a concubine will be miserable in the future, right? \"Have you eaten enough just now? I asked the kitchen to make a few snacks.\" After saying that, he motioned to the servant behind him to bring the basket to the table. He placed everything properly, wiped the temperature of the plate wall with his hand, and called: \"It's still warm. Just ready.\" Looking at the dazzling array of snacks on the table, Luo Xue was stunned for a moment. The brief warmth flashed across like a meteor, but was replaced by Yan Shubing's gloomy face. I wonder if Sister Yanshu has eaten well? \"What are you thinking about? Hurry up and eat.\" Prince Yu called him again. Luo Xue had no choice but to pick up a piece and put it into her mouth. \"Prince!\" The housekeeper came over in a hurry and saw Luo Xue here. He restrained himself a little, covered his mouth and whispered in Prince Yu's ear. Prince Yu looked at Luo Xue and told him, \"Just do whatever you like.\"Make a note of it and ask the kitchen to make it regularly in the future. \"Then he left quickly. Seeing him walking away, he called Xiao happy: \"Xiao happy! \"Miss, what's the matter?\" \"Put these snacks in the basket and let's go see my sister.\" \"Miss, where do you have a sister?\" \"Xiao happy was puzzled. \"I mean let's go see Sister Yanshu. \"But miss, do you know the way?\" \"Isn't there a bearer?\" \"Luo Xue pointed to the sedan bearer on the other side with her eyes. She was sure that this was arranged by Xunyang. Wouldn't it be a pity to use such a great resource?... The bearer carried the sedan chair through the intricate roads of the palace. Five steps to the first floor, ten steps to the pavilion. Five spines and six The mountain-like glazed roof shines in the sunlight. The large and small pavilions are arranged according to the terrain. The rockery and shallow lake are arranged in a random manner, which is eye-catching and dazzling. \"Madam, we are here. \"The bearer of the sedan chair opened the curtain for Luo Xue. Luo Xue smiled and stepped out of the sedan. Most of the buildings in Songmeixuan are mainly built with hanging mountain roofs. Compared with the ones we just saw, the grade is slightly lower, but there is still a plaque inlaid with red background and gold letters at the door, with the words \"Songmeixuan\" written on it. The courtyard is full of plum blossoms, which makes Luo Xue think of the plum garden, and she is undoubtedly a little closer to the inkstone. \"Sister, are you there? Luo Xue said as she walked into the yard. \"Who is it?\" \"The girl who came out was a girl. When she saw Luo Xue coming, she hurriedly bowed and said, \"My slave, please pay your respects to the Seventh Madam. \"Get up. I wonder if my sister is here?\" \"Madam, my old illness recurred during breakfast, and I lay down when I came back.\" \"The maid said without any subtlety. \"Then can I go see my sister? \"Madam, come with me.\" \"After that, the maid took Luo Xue to the inner room. Luo Xue, who had just arrived in the inner room, was choked by the medicinal gas in the room without resisting, and couldn't help coughing twice. \"Sister, don't blame me. After months of taking medicine, the smell of medicine filled the house. \"Yan Shu, who was lying on the bed, explained. He was about to get up to greet the guests, but was stopped by Luo Xue. \"Sister, I feel unwell. Have you called a doctor? \"It's an old illness, so it's all in vain. It's just a few medicines thrown in and out.\" \"Yan Shu said with a smile. \"Sister, why did you think about it? Luo Xue sat next to Yan Shu and held her hand with her hand, \"I'm here to thank my sister. I just thanked her for it.\" \"I didn't do anything just now. Why does my sister need to say thank you?\" I can't afford the inkstone. \"Sister, you are humble.\" \" Luo Xue raised her lips and gave a bright smile. She stood up, took the basket in Xiao Xi's hand, put several snacks on the nearby table one by one, and said, \"Sister, did you eat well just now? I brought a few snacks, but I’m just wondering if there’s anything you like? Yanshu looked at Luo Xue and said sadly, \"My sister has just entered the palace and is already familiar with the palace. It's great.\" Thinking about it, it has been a year since I entered the mansion, and the only places I visited were Pinjuxuan and Songmeixuan. \"Sister, don't you often hang out with people?\" Luo Xue was surprised. \"If you want to move around, you are not familiar with the place. You still need to ask for directions. You are not favored, so why bother to bother others?\" \" Yan Shu's tone was as calm as if he was born in the world. \"Who said my sister is not loved? These snacks were sent by the prince. \"My lord, aren't you passionate? Why are you so decisive in your treatment of the sick woman? She is also someone you have loved, right? Is it true that only the Yingying Yanyan who surrounds you every day can win your pity for a long time?\" \"Sister, I'm joking. The prince has never been in such a state of mind. Sister's heart, sister can receive it. Yan Shu covered his mouth with his hand and coughed, \"How can there be so many women in the palace that the prince can miss?\" Sister, forgive me for speaking frankly...\" \"Huh? Luo Xue hesitated, \"Sister, please tell me?\" \"My sister is one of the few people who can make the prince miss me. You must cherish her.\" I have always felt that marriage is just a part of a power transaction, but when I see my sister, I feel that you and the prince are a loving couple. As for whether it is a good marriage, it is up to my sister to decide. \"My sister was joking. Luo Xue is just a woman with the same fate as her sister.\" \"I hope so. Some things cannot be concealed.\" \" Yanshu didn't try to prove anything anymore. She knew that a smart woman like Luo Xue understood. Some things cannot be concealed? Could it be that her behavior showed different emotions? No, how could such a prince who is always affectionate be the ideal candidate for her heart? However, after several months of acquaintance, such a prince can also evoke the true feelings behind his mask.In fact, if I agreed to him easily in the first place because I was angry with the fortune teller, then how could I explain why I couldn't wait to find out if he was here to propose marriage? Seeing Luo Xue deep in thought, Yanshu sat up from the bed and said, \"Sister, let's take a look at something.\" As he said that, he lifted up his sleeves. When Luo Xue came to her senses, she saw a red cinnabar mole lying ostentatiously on Yan Shu's arm, which was as white as snow. \"This is?\" \"Shou Gong Sha,\" Yan Shu said with a sweet smile, \"Sometimes the prince, like us, has no right to choose marriage. Even so, he can still decide his own destiny.\" \"Sister, why are you showing Luo Xue this?\" Obviously Luo Xue didn't believe it. \"You are different from us, and you are different from her.\" Yan Shu told Luo Xue. In fact, when she saw Luo Xue for the first time, she felt that she was different from others. She could feel the difference in Luo Xue's heart. Even though it was too rash to have a heart-to-heart relationship now, she never wanted to see her sad alone at breakfast. Since there is love, then love bravely. \"She? Who is she?\" Realizing that he had said too much, Yanshu hurriedly changed his words and said, \"It's nothing, sister, I'm a little tired.\" She didn't get an answer, but the sensible Luo Xue knew that she was giving an order to expel guests, \"Then sister, just rest.\" After that, he left without stopping.",
